OL,3,GNEWSACafe staff 'on edge' after second 
OL,4,Abreak-in                               
OL,6,FA cafe owner in Peterborough says staff
OL,7,Fare scared and "on edge" about going to
OL,8,Fwork after it was broken into for a    
OL,9,Fsecond time.                           
OL,11,FOwner Sarina Querashi said she         
OL,12,Fdiscovered the damage when she arrived 
OL,13,Fat Cafe Yu, on Dogsthorpe Road, on     
OL,14,FSunday morning.                        
OL,16,FThe cafe, which is staffed by women,   
OL,17,Fwas also targeted last December.       
