OL,6,FThe break-in comes at a time of        
OL,7,Fheightened anxiety in the Millfield    
OL,8,Farea following the death of a          
OL,9,F55-year-old man after a robbery at Lala
OL,10,FJewellers in Gladstone Street last     
OL,11,Fweek.                                  
